OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly fog in the northwest will
OL,6,Fclear, leaving a largely dry day with
OL,7,Fvariable cloud and sunny spells. A few
OL,8,Fshowers are possible, mainly in the
OL,9,Feast and southeast. It will feel quite
OL,10,Fchilly in the south with brisk winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly dry night with
OL,13,Fplenty of cloud and the odd shower.
OL,14,FClear spells in northern areas could
OL,15,Fallow patches of fog and frost to
OL,16,Fform. Staying breezy further south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
