OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA cold start in the north
OL,6,Fwith the best sunshine developing
OL,7,Fthere. Further south, expect more
OL,8,Fcloud, a few isolated showers, and a
OL,9,Fchilly breeze. Temperatures near
OL,10,Faverage overall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
